{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-turtle-sheltered-bays","revision":1,"title_en":"Why Young Sea Turtles May Stay in a Bay","title_zh":"年轻海龟为何常留在海湾","level":"B1","primary_topic":"psychology_science","tags":["science","animals"],"source_type":"licensed_adaptation","fiction":false,"summary_zh":"研究人员在哥斯达黎加海湾观察到年轻的玳瑁海龟，分析平静的海湾如何为幼龟提供丰富的食物和躲避风浪的场所。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-21T10:03:40Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"Near the Pacific coast of Costa Rica, a sea turtle can swim into a bay where coral and rocks break up the sea floor.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"在哥斯达黎加的太平洋沿岸，海龟可以游进一处珊瑚与岩石打破海床平整地貌的海湾。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":4,"surface":"Near","lemma":"near","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在……附近；靠近"},{"start":5,"end":8,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"这处"},{"start":9,"end":16,"surface":"Pacific","lemma":"Pacific","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"太平洋的"},{"start":17,"end":22,"surface":"coast","lemma":"coast","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"海岸"},{"start":23,"end":25,"surface":"of","lemma":"of","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"……的"},{"start":26,"end":31,"surface":"Costa","lemma":"Costa","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"哥斯达"},{"start":32,"end":36,"surface":"Rica","lemma":"Rica","pos":"专有名词","gloss_zh":"黎加"},{"start":38,"end":39,"surface":"a","lemma":"a","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一只"},{"start":40,"end":43,"surface":"sea","lemma":"sea","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"海（作定语修饰turtle）"},{"start":44,"end":50,"surface":"turtle","lemma":"turtle","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"海龟"},{"start":51,"end":54,"surface":"can","lemma":"can","pos":"情态动词","gloss_zh":"能够；可以"},{"start":55,"end":59,"surface":"swim","lemma":"swim","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"游；游动"},{"start":60,"end":64,"surface":"into","lemma":"into","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"进入……内部"},{"start":65,"end":66,"surface":"a","lemma":"a","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一个"},{"start":67,"end":70,"surface":"bay","lemma":"bay","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"海湾"},{"start":71,"end":76,"surface":"where","lemma":"where","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"引出定语从句，表示在那里"},{"start":77,"end